WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:02.745
Start by adding a production machine.

2
00:00:02.985 --> 00:00:07.495
Name it Demo Loom Zero One, and select Rapier as
the machine type.

3
00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:22.391
Add the machine, ready for assignment.

4
00:00:26.800 --> 00:00:29.501
Next, add Demo Operator Zero One.

5
00:00:29.741 --> 00:00:32.431
Select piece rate for this worker's pay type.

6
00:00:39.300 --> 00:00:44.849
Set the role, keep the worker approved as a loom
operator, and choose day availability.

7
00:00:45.089 --> 00:00:46.651
Then save the worker.

8
00:00:56.000 --> 00:01:01.441
Activate a quality for production, and choose
version two of the saved demo fabric.

9
00:01:07.000 --> 00:01:10.744
Before production can start, check the required
yarn stock.

10
00:01:10.984 --> 00:01:13.610
This fabric needs both warp and weft.

11
00:01:17.800 --> 00:01:22.737
Add two hundred kilograms of warp yarn, with a
short stock note, then save.

12
00:01:32.000 --> 00:01:33.711
Repeat for the weft yarn.

13
00:01:33.951 --> 00:01:38.068
Add two hundred kilograms and a reference note,
then save the stock.

14
00:01:48.000 --> 00:01:52.374
With both yarn stocks available, activate the
quality for production.

15
00:01:58.000 --> 00:02:00.704
Open Assign Looms for the active quality.

16
00:02:00.944 --> 00:02:04.571
Select Demo Loom Zero One and confirm the
assignment.

17
00:02:14.000 --> 00:02:16.893
The machine board connects your fabric to its
loom.

18
00:02:17.133 --> 00:02:18.727
Search for the demo loom.

19
00:02:22.800 --> 00:02:26.736
Open Manage Workers on the demo loom, and select
Day Shift.

20
00:02:35.000 --> 00:02:39.533
Find Demo Operator Zero One and assign the
worker to the day shift.

21
00:02:39.773 --> 00:02:41.133
Then finish setup.

22
00:02:50.200 --> 00:02:53.157
Open the daily sheet for the correct date and
shift.

23
00:02:53.397 --> 00:02:56.813
Enter two hundred and forty metres for the demo
loom.

24
00:03:00.900 --> 00:03:05.445
Open Worker Review to check output and earnings,
then return to the sheet.

25
00:03:09.800 --> 00:03:11.046
Save the shift.

26
00:03:11.286 --> 00:03:17.388
Other machines remain pending, so only the demo
loom has recorded output in this example.

27
00:03:22.300 --> 00:03:25.649
Open the saved receipt to review the production
record,

28
00:03:25.769 --> 00:03:27.007
including the loom,

29
00:03:27.127 --> 00:03:28.087
quality,

30
00:03:28.207 --> 00:03:29.831
operator and metres.

31
00:03:39.000 --> 00:03:42.701
The worker earned three thousand eight hundred
and forty rupees.
